  {
    "episode_id": 50690,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/0/50690.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 3,
    "turn_text": "Thank you, Leader. I got a lot to talk to you about. The CR, the AMV, Radio and Every Vehicle Act, and especially reconciliation. But I want to start by getting your reaction. Seven years ago, a madman tried to kill you in every Republican in Congress. And you survived. You're an inspiration to every victim of crime out there. What do you think when people glorify the assassin of Brian Thompson? When you hear that on air, what do you think?",
